@startuml fig-S20-e3-states
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false

title S20 — Object Lifecycle State Machine

[*] --> Present : seed data or INSERT
state Present {
  Present : QUERY / GET this key: return current value
  Present : UPDATE commit: increment revision and notify
  Present : Unknown other key: ERR_NOT_FOUND
  Present : Reads and rejected requests preserve this object
}
Present --> Deleted : DELETE commit
Deleted --> [*]

legend right
  State is per object key
  Notifications follow committed UPDATE and DELETE events
  Durable storage is the source of truth
  Watch state belongs to sessions, not objects
endlegend
@enduml
